0": 0.13516483516483516, "y0": 0.5174825174825175, "x1": 0.6351648351648351, "y1": 0.5306915306915307}, {"text": "Suddenly the whole page came into focus.", "x0": 0.13406593406593406, "y0": 0.5501165501165501, "x1": 0.46923076923076923, "y1": 0.5633255633255633}, {"text": "\u2018Your response should draw on your knowledge and understanding of Textual Dynamics.", "x0": 0.13516483516483516, "y0": 0.581973581973582, "x1": 0.8472527472527472, "y1": 0.5959595959595959}, {"text": "-13-", "x0": 0.4989010989010989, "y0": 0.9463869463869464, "x1": 0.5406593406593406, "y1": 0.9564879564879565}], [{"text": "In your answers you will be assessed on how well you:", "x0": 0.14175824175824175, "y0": 0.0947940947940948, "x1": 0.5813186813186814, "y1": 0.108003108003108}, {"text": "= demonstrate understanding of the ways in which language shapes and reflects culture and", "x0": 0.14285714285714285, "y0": 0.11732711732711733, "x1": 0.9076923076923077, "y1": 0.1320901320901321}, {"text": "values", "x0": 0.1901098901098901, "y0": 0.13442113442113443, "x1": 0.24065934065934066, "y1": 0.1452991452991453}, {"text": "m\u2122 sustain an extended composition appropriate to the question, demonstrating control in the", "x0": 0.14175824175824175, "y0": 0.15073815073815075, "x1": 0.9098901098901099, "y1": 0.16472416472416473}, {"text": "use of language.", "x0": 0.1901098901098901, "y0": 0.16705516705516704, "x1": 0.3208791208791209, "y1": 0.18026418026418026}, {"text": "Question 15 \u2014 Elective 2: Language and Gender (25 marks)", "x0": 0.14175824175824175, "y0": 0.222999222999223, "x1": 0.6648351648351648, "y1": 0.23620823620823622}, {"text": "In Language and Gender, significant texts explore and critique the impact of gender on", "x0": 0.14175824175824175, "y0": 0.2540792540792541, "x1": 0.8406593406593407, "y1": 0.2680652680652681}, {"text": "representations of the contemporary world and are valued for the varied ways they do this.", "x0": 0.14065934065934066, "y0": 0.2703962703962704, "x1": 0.8670329670329671, "y1": 0.28438228438228436}, {"text": "Write an essay in which you explore the extent to which this is true of the texts you have", "x0": 0.14175824175824175, "y0": 0.30225330225330227, "x1": 0.856043956043956, "y1": 0.3162393162393162}, {"text": "studied in this elective.", "x0": 0.14175824175824175, "y0": 0.31934731934731936, "x1": 0.32857142857142857, "y1": 0.33022533022533024}, {"text": "In your response, refer to TWO prescribed texts AND texts of your own choosing.", "x0": 0.14175824175824175, "y0": 0.35120435120435123, "x1": 0.8021978021978022, "y1": 0.3651903651903652}, {"text": "Question 16 \u2014 Elective 2: Language and Gender (25 marks)", "x0": 0.14285714285714285, "y0": 0.4654234654234654, "x1": 0.654945054945055, "y1": 0.47863247863247865}, {"text": "Compose a piece of original imaginative writing using the following statement as part of a", "x0": 0.14285714285714285, "y0": 0.49417249417249415, "x1": 0.8736263736263736, "y1": 0.5151515151515151}, {"text": "character\u2019s changing understanding of values in his or her life.", "x0": 0.14285714285714285, "y0": 0.5143745143745144, "x1": 0.643956043956044, "y1": 0.5275835275835276}, {"text": "There are times when you can\u2019t help but stand out from the crowd.", "x0": 0.14285714285714285, "y0": 0.5462315462315462, "x1": 0.6780219780219781, "y1": 0.5602175602175602}, {"text": "Your response should draw on your knowledge and understanding of Language and Gender.", "x0": 0.14175824175824175, "y0": 0.578088578088578, "x1": 0.8835164835164835, "y1": 0.5928515928515928}, {"text": "End of Paper", "x0": 0.4714285714285714, "y0": 0.6612276612276612, "x1": 0.5846153846153846, "y1": 0.6736596736596736}, {"text": "-14-", "x0": 0.5076923076923077, "y0": 0.9417249417249417, "x1": 0.5494505494505495, "y1": 0.9518259518259519}]]